uint64_t absolute(uint64_t frames) { uint64_t t; nanoseconds_to_absolutetime(frames * 1000000000ULL / Rate, &t); return t; }
// OneiOS (fix-audio-volume): the speaker's volume control as the HAL reads it (24A446 CoreAudio's HALS_IOA2Control):
// class 'vlme', base class 'levl', output scope, main element; integers 0..128 over one range from -64 dB in 0.5 dB
// steps (dB values Fixed64, as the sample rates). Step 0 is silence, 128 is 0 dB (the stream as iOS made it).
